screenshots": [{"file_name": "llmqsscreen0.png", "id": "25542004352052534", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830911_25542004355385867_2660512741608142959_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GxkYxv510K0Q7kNvwEmI--J&_nc_oc=Adlcm3thhZ4DpwSbnrfrhdIqrZBf9cETk55Bw7zwLxKdJAUFcfr8tafcCqlPGDaCrYg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsJjVAT13ZbOV0hPDs_L_4ZprM7chqhotru_j_tstKvMQ&oe=699AF87D"}, {"file_name": "llmqsscreen01.png", "id": "1172437191016153", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295566_1172437194349486_4771640758952660999_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zEQZ7JsgNcAQ7kNvwHpiL1p&_nc_oc=AdnJLTcdikFpA7IbhYeJWAA2Gquu91iSBqVI6ElnTwcSk5IJbEeJTh8JGSkDf7sI_Eo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft_qpISzQ-8n7tZFCdnSeAb8JGtw03Ie2bR9UUCFT0Alw&oe=699B02A3"}, {"file_name": "ll_screen_5 (Custom).png", "id": "726894816758218", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295992_726894820091551_5452241889637422275_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NVdGHxNnF48Q7kNvwE84i8q&_nc_oc=Adk8F9UiJMcLiXEzES3qNgzW4v4OyFj9VUqv7DsTOa4Sp3NX2IwbUhuFn1BGMXj5kbg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsoCm3Lsij0YItoasauFNRW8ysORgSkc-FuGYnsBbDEDw&oe=699B10DA"}, {"file_name": "ll_rnm.png", "id": "1373923397728536", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820548_1373923401061869_3991556325281811630_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5T27dkyWh7wQ7kNvwFNJQxU&_nc_oc=Adl6apnxjXT60p7SjNdRT9LNh245fNiGNcqjFgzKhAOcUpaw2kxsJ_A6owj3N1hMY54&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuIjjAczLroPPuuCWl6ojyUzcJGiichyjDksyrRmpapNg&oe=699AE715"}, {"file_name": "ll_screen_0 (Custom).png", "id": "676714685414462", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312332_676714688747795_8046625622296889740_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6i4dqi-kqbMQ7kNvwFW3qr9&_nc_oc=AdnpsZI-kfHdWcineaODzCmc8Ty23mTgdsog3AO7EOEViiD3vy7L1MYUdEI1xY2e9oI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftoyW20Tl3QMuqnDzQXi6OJJr8YKalvHzLxXUTVtCVx4A&oe=699B0477"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Lightning Launcher", "keywords": ["Launcher", "Apps", "Lightning", "Search"], "long_description": "# Sort, Search, and Launch Anything\nLightning Launcher is a launcher designed for Oculus Quest that supports **all** your apps and games.\n\nIt has been built with a focus on speed, flexiblity, and convenience.\n\nIt can run on any Android device, but has been tailored for the lastest updates to the Oculus/Meta Quest OS.\n\n### \ud83c\udfa8 **Simple but Powerful Interface**\n- Flexible UI with a focus on ease-of-use\n- Manually hide, rename, or replace the icon of any app\n- Constantly updated HD banner images, icons, and labels for all Quest apps\n- Change apps to display as icons or banners - individually, or by type.\n- Change the size or spacing of apps to show more apps at once\n- Choose from 10 preset styles, or import your own custom wallpaper\n\n### \ud83c\udf10 **Websites in the Launcher**\n- Enter edit mode and then select \"Add Website\" on the bottom right\n- You can also set website to open in the Meta Quest Browser or default browser on supported systems\n- Websites will be automatically given labels and high-res icons; both can be customized as you wish\n\n### \ud83d\udce6 **App Groups**\n- Automatic grouping of apps by platform\n- Easily sort apps into up to 20 custom groups\n\n### \u2b50 **Star Apps**\n- Apps you've starred will be moved to the front of the list for easier access\n\n### \ud83d\udd0d **Search**\n- Search all your apps at once!", "short_description": "Sort, search, and launch all your apps.\n\nLightning Launcher combines all your apps and websites in an intuitive interface, and gives you powerful customization well beyond the Quest's default app library. "}]}, "developer_name": "Ethan M.", "develop